    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88924" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδοξάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>add to opinion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				209d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>import into judgement</i> an element <i>additional to</i>
			sense-impression, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1pp.12,19
			</span></i> U.(
				Pass.
			). <i><span class="en">
				<u>Nat.</u>
				10
			</span></i> G. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>imagine further</i> or <i>besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεδοξάσθη περὶ τῆς θαλάττης ταύτης
					πολλὰ ψεύδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.7.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -δοξαζόμενον τοῖς ὀνόμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.84
				</span></i>
			.</div>
